    "name": "The Story Of A Game Company's Growth",
    "steam_appid": 3841370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you filled with boundless curiosity about game development? Do you like running a game company? Do you want to witness the birth of each of your works? Do you want to learn more knowledge that you've never heard before, such as history, astronomy, life, humanities, geography... Then come on, create your own game company and become the brightest star of this era. In the game, you will run a company, and your main source of income mainly comes from product development and outsourcing development. The influencing factors of product development mainly include the various attributes of the employees, the publicity platform, and the number of diamonds used. Early outsourcing development is a good choice, and the income is usually not very high, but the advantage is that the development cycle is shorter. If you start your own product development stage, you can obtain information through market research to maximize your income. In addition, there are four knowledge competitions throughout the year, held in spring, summer, autumn, and winter. Based on the answering situation, you can obtain income. Winning at the annual award ceremony can also get a bonus. Diamonds are obtained mainly through the performance of employees during development or certain random events. The training room can enhance or reduce the attributes of employees through the completion of mini-games. For employees, you can recruit them in the talent market. You need to pay wages monthly. In the employee information, you can dismiss employees, but you need to pay a fee. If you don't pay wages for three consecutive months, the company may go bankrupt. In addition, some small game details will be described in the encyclopedia.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you filled with boundless curiosity about game development? Do you like running a game company? Do you want to witness the birth of each of your works? Do you want to learn more knowledge that you've never heard before, such as history, astronomy, life, humanities, geography... Then come on, create your own game company and become the brightest star of this era. In the game, you will run a company, and your main source of income mainly comes from product development and outsourcing development. The influencing factors of product development mainly include the various attributes of the employees, the publicity platform, and the number of diamonds used. Early outsourcing development is a good choice, and the income is usually not very high, but the advantage is that the development cycle is shorter. If you start your own product development stage, you can obtain information through market research to maximize your income. In addition, there are four knowledge competitions throughout the year, held in spring, summer, autumn, and winter. Based on the answering situation, you can obtain income. Winning at the annual award ceremony can also get a bonus. Diamonds are obtained mainly through the performance of employees during development or certain random events. The training room can enhance or reduce the attributes of employees through the completion of mini-games. For employees, you can recruit them in the talent market. You need to pay wages monthly. In the employee information, you can dismiss employees, but you need to pay a fee. If you don't pay wages for three consecutive months, the company may go bankrupt. In addition, some small game details will be described in the encyclopedia.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a casual game simulation game. You will run a game company. Through product development, outsourcing development, random events, annual award ceremonies, knowledge competitions, etc., you can accumulate wealth and build your own territory.",
